@startuml
title SASE URL Filtering Engine - Distributed Microservices Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Enterprise Admin / Ops" as admin

component "Central Manager (CM)\n- HA & Cluster Mgmt\n- Signature ID Generator\n(DPI Signature Mapping)" as CM

component "Provisioning Module (PM)\n(Java)\n- Enterprise/Group/Conn\n- Policy: WL/BL\n- URLs provision" as PM

component "Core Service Integration (CSI)\n(Java)\n- User onboarding\n- SUPI/MSISDN\n- Assigned IP mapping" as CSI

component "Malicious Resource Indicator (MRI)\n(Java)\n- Fetch malicious URLs\n- Categorize threats\n- Sources: URLHaus etc" as MRI

component "Kafka Cluster\n(Policy & Data bus)" as Kafka

database "Aerospike Cluster\n(Distributed KV Store)" as Aero

component "SASEURLFILTER (SASEDP)\n(C/C++)\n- Dataplane (DPDK)\n- URL Filter + DPI\n- Allow/Block Decision" as DP

admin --> PM : Create Enterprise/Group\nWL/BL Policies

PM --> Aero : Store policy datasets
CSI --> Aero : Store user datasets
MRI --> Aero : Store malicious datasets

PM --> Kafka : Publish policy updates
CSI --> Kafka : Publish user updates
MRI --> Kafka : Publish malicious updates

Kafka --> DP : Subscribe & sync\n(User + Policy + Threat intel)

CM --> PM : HA / service orchestration
CM --> CSI : HA / orchestration
CM --> MRI : HA / orchestration
CM --> Kafka : Cluster coordination
CM --> Aero : Cluster coordination

CM --> DP : Cluster HA\nSignature IDs for DPI

note right of DP
DP makes decisions locally
(no runtime REST calls)
Data pushed via Kafka
end note

@enduml
